# credentials for the engine test lane's open cloud host. copy to .env, which is
# gitignored, and fill in. the same three names are the github repository secrets.
#
# the key needs one access permission, restricted to the test experience:
# universe.place.luau-execution-session with the write operation. write also
# covers polling the task and reading its logs, so no read operation is needed.
#
# nothing is uploaded, so no place permission is needed either: darklua bundles
# the specs into the task script itself. the place only has to exist and be
# published once.
#
# use a universe created solely for this. a task can reach cloud-backed engine
# apis including datastores, and those writes persist, so a key scoped to a
# universe holding real data would let approved fork pull requests touch it.

ROBLOX_API_KEY=
ROBLOX_UNIVERSE_ID=
ROBLOX_PLACE_ID=
